* MINT-ERRORS: 27 10 27 10 27
* Ref: ../dbase3-decomp/specs/commands/set-commands.md:225
* PRINTER.OUT is the independent raw LPT stream. Rules pinned here (re-minted
* 2026-11-01 from probes): margin is emitted after every LF written to the
* printer (not after CR/FF, not at the very start of a ?? line), PCOL excludes
* it, the value truncates toward zero, negative -> 0, 16-bit signed wrap.
? "[W2-BEGIN]"
? "[DEFAULT ZERO MARGIN]"
SET PRINT ON
? "X"
SET PRINT OFF
EJECT
SET MARGIN TO 5
? "[FIVE COLUMN MARGIN]"
SET PRINT ON
? "X"
SET PRINT OFF
EJECT
SET MARGIN TO 0
? "[MARGIN RESTORED TO ZERO]"
SET PRINT ON
? "X"
SET PRINT OFF
? "[NONNUMERIC MARGIN]"
SET MARGIN TO "BAD"
? "[MISSING TO]"
SET MARGIN 5
? "[LF AND CR RULES]"
SET MARGIN TO 3
SET PRINT ON
?? "A"
?
?? "B"
? "C", "D"
? "E" + CHR(10) + "F"
?? "G" + CHR(13) + "H"
?? "I" + CHR(12) + "J"
SET PRINT OFF
? "[PCOL EXCLUDES MARGIN]"
SET PRINT ON
?
?? PCOL()
SET PRINT OFF
EJECT
? "[ERRORS KEEP THE MARGIN]"
SET MARGIN TO 4
SET MARGIN TO .T.
SET MARGIN TO
SET MARGIN TO "7"
SET PRINT ON
? "K"
SET PRINT OFF
? "[TRUNCATE AND CLAMP]"
SET MARGIN TO 5.7
SET PRINT ON
? "T57"
SET PRINT OFF
SET MARGIN TO 0.9
SET PRINT ON
? "T09"
SET PRINT OFF
SET MARGIN TO 3
SET MARGIN TO -1
SET PRINT ON
? "N1"
SET PRINT OFF
SET MARGIN TO 3
SET MARGIN TO -0.5
SET PRINT ON
? "N05"
SET PRINT OFF
? "[EXPRESSIONS]"
SET MARGIN TO 1 + 2
SET PRINT ON
? "E3"
SET PRINT OFF
STORE 4 TO MV
SET MARGIN TO MV
SET PRINT ON
? "V4"
SET PRINT OFF
SET MARGIN TO 2, 6
SET PRINT ON
? "L2"
SET PRINT OFF
? "[WIDE AND WRAPPED]"
SET MARGIN TO 256
SET PRINT ON
? "W256"
SET PRINT OFF
SET MARGIN TO 70000
SET PRINT ON
? "W70000"
SET PRINT OFF
SET MARGIN TO 3
SET MARGIN TO 32768
SET PRINT ON
? "W32768"
SET PRINT OFF
SET MARGIN TO 0
? "[W2-END]"
RETURN
